From 0c03b8bae083ca030f68acab75a0bcf33a020b46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>
Date: Thu, 20 Nov 2025 14:24:00 +0100
Subject: fbdev: tcx.c fix mem_map to correct smem_start offset
MIME-Version: 1.0
