Subject: f2fs: fix return value of f2fs_recover_fsync_data()

commit 01fba45deaddcce0d0b01c411435d1acf6feab7b upstream.

With below scripts, it will trigger panic in f2fs:

mkfs.f2fs -f /dev/vdd
