From 60d222f8deb815be3e137f157780b2cd12b1b0a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Heiko Carstens <hca@linux.ibm.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 08:55:10 +0100
Subject: s390/xor: Fix xor_xc_2() inline assembly constraints

[ Upstream commit f775276edc0c505dc0f782773796c189f31a1123 ]

